author: codex-agent
resolution: "Delivered by PR #165, merge 84d1cde6211d9330ed659c39a756259e58c2f9c8, merged 2026-10-25T18:06:34Z. index.ts createPmItem delegates ordinary import/sync and legacy creates to PmClient.create; expected failures use createPmCliExpectedError and EXIT_CODE. test/sdk-adoption.test.ts covers no-executable/non-git creates and fields, partial success, SDK error recognition and independent history-corruption detection."
expected_result: "Ordinary imports and expected failures use the native SDK while retaining fields, partial success and integrity boundaries."
actual_result: Four focused adoption regressions pass on main. Existing atomic import/completeness paths remain SDK-owned; Hound parser remediation and all PR #167 items remain open.
